{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17203","headline":"奉和李给事省中书情寄刘苗崔三曹长因呈许陈二阁老 · 权德舆","name":"奉和李给事省中书情寄刘苗崔三曹长因呈许陈二阁老","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"常寮几处伏明光，新诏联翩夕拜郎。\n五夜漏清天欲曙，万年枝暖日初长。\n分曹列侍登文石，促膝闲谣接羽觞。\n共说汉朝荣上赏，岂令三友滞冯唐。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17203.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17203","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}